<% // The field to rename is stored in the variable 'field'. The current schema is in the variable 'schema' %>
-- MySql doesn't let you rename a column without the requirement that you have to specify every single bit of specification of that same column
-- As that info isn't available at this level, renames are not emitted into this script. Please rename the column manually:
-- In table `<%=field.ParentTable.Name%>`, rename column `<%=GetOriginalName(field)%>` to `<%=GetNewName(field)%>`
